    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "113facda-10eb-3148-90e1-e84d52098944",
                "word": "trappings",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8d8feb15-ba1f-3075-ac45-f955f059bbfa",
                        "entry_id": "113facda-10eb-3148-90e1-e84d52098944",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clothing or equipment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a6b37ab-7d46-4658-b975-1e8ff3f90442",
                                "sense_id": "8d8feb15-ba1f-3075-ac45-f955f059bbfa",
                                "text": "He went through his belongings, gradually shedding the trappings of youth."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6502ee87-3def-3f9f-b860-8a1dd88f12af",
                        "entry_id": "113facda-10eb-3148-90e1-e84d52098944",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something which gives the appearance of something."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b59988b4-368e-4670-9089-7a0f3eefd52a",
                                "sense_id": "6502ee87-3def-3f9f-b860-8a1dd88f12af",
                                "text": "Whether any of the relatives of the seamen whose names appeared there were now among the congregation, I knew not; but so many are the unrecorded accidents in the fishery, and so plainly did several women present wear the countenance if not the trappings of some unceasing grief, that I feel sure that here before me were assembled those, in whose unhealing hearts the sight of those bleak tablets sympathetically caused the old wounds to bleed afresh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c29ebc57-058b-437d-8ea2-4bd643ebf928",
                                "sense_id": "6502ee87-3def-3f9f-b860-8a1dd88f12af",
                                "text": "Two years on, and while the Sultan of Slowjamastan has instigated more than a few bizarre laws (he’s outlawed the wearing of Crocs, for example), the Republic also has all the trappings of a fledgling nation-state. It issues its own passports, flies its own flag, prints its own currency (“the duble”), and has a national anthem that’s played on state occasions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a45e77b-57a7-4b88-8451-70425786fb87",
                                "sense_id": "6502ee87-3def-3f9f-b860-8a1dd88f12af",
                                "text": "The second half was not a siege of the England goal but it had the trappings of it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d6c4935e-93ef-301d-a266-82ae4d829436",
                        "entry_id": "113facda-10eb-3148-90e1-e84d52098944",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ornamental coverings or harnesses for a horse; caparisons."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a325b126-c70a-4114-a733-9d1419c67a42",
                        "source_entry_id": "113facda-10eb-3148-90e1-e84d52098944",
                        "source_sense_description": "clothing which gives the appearance",
                        "target_lang_word": "accoutrement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "accoutrement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                        "entry_id": "2c831d2a-4308-3d63-851b-436f60a570ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Habillement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d1c0ac6-911c-4c70-b756-da6b70d17001",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "Enfin je n'y tins plus, je mis bas pantalon, bottes et chaussettes, je complétai mon accoutrement de pêcheur sur le modèle de celui de Maurice, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faccbed9-51c5-43fa-8a2e-aef1f9701b69",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "Des bonnets de fourrure, des ceintures de peau de daim complétaient l'accoutrement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e58f2e7-1dd4-4010-83d4-0d3ebcfa6f32",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "[…], un accoutrement de voyage qui n’est de bon goût ni dans sa coupe démodée ni dans sa couleur tapageuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f81eeb62-4e80-48e1-9607-44926e41a32a",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "Pensant à son accoutrement, il se défit de son faux-col et de sa casquette blanche d’aéronaute, qui pouvaient le trahir, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3ee8d15-ad80-46f1-a6f1-81afaa71d132",
                                                "sense_id": "bb4653c3-5b5e-34fd-9e6f-89cc63895864",
                                                "text": "Où donc était-il passé depuis le temps, car il n’avait assurément pu songer, dans l’accoutrement où il était, à descendre en ville ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "414e670f-beef-3924-8b1c-e4889a598485",
                                        "entry_id": "2c831d2a-4308-3d63-851b-436f60a570ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tenue vestimentaire surprenante."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72497fd9-8d3e-40aa-b087-28d9cf8e3c7e",
                                                "sense_id": "414e670f-beef-3924-8b1c-e4889a598485",
                                                "text": "On lui ordonna d’ôter la belle pelisse dont elle était revêtue, ce qu’elle refusa de faire, et si opiniâtrement que les valets du bourreau furent obligés de l’attacher au poteau dans cet accoutrement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
